      <prov:agent rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vgo_prov#agent_OntoGeneration_Agent"/>
      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vgo_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes and properties to answer every atomic competency question. Classes AchievementOwner and ItemOwner serve as shared superclasses for Game and Player per the axioms. General properties gameInteraction and friendAchievementRelation unify relations sharing identical domains and ranges. Domain, range, subclass, disjointness, and subproperty axioms are materialized exactly as required by the tests and input axioms.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

<prov:Activity rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vgo_prov#OntoCorrectionActivity">
