    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>Fixed multiple Themis 'Conflict' errors by removing redundant explicit domain declarations on hasAchievement and hasItem that created empty intersections with disjoint classes, leaving only the shared superclass domains (AchievementOwner and ItemOwner). Ensured all other properties have single, explicit domain and range axioms matching the tests. Added missing axioms for playedAt, playDuration, hasEquipment, uses, hasMade, livesIn, and hasPlayingArea to resolve path conflicts.</vaem:rationale>
