<earl:TestResult rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vgo_prov#Report_r10_themis_test_53">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
  <earl:outcome rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/earl#failed"/>
  <prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vgo_prov#Check_r10_themis_test_53"/>
  <prov:value>Themis tests: 28/31 CQs pass all their tests. FAILING TESTS:
CQ10:
  Achievement type AchievementType -&gt; Incorrect
CQ11:
  Achievement type AchievementType -&gt; Incorrect
CQ27:
  Achievement type AchievementType -&gt; Incorrect
Fix each failing test in the ontology: Undefined = add the term under exactly that name; Incorrect = declare it with the right type; Absent = add the tested axiom so the knowledge is modelled; Conflict = the ontology contradicts the test, correct the axioms.</prov:value>
</earl:TestResult>

